# Build context for the Puspa deploy image (Dockerfile).
#
# The image builds everything it serves: the Python venv is built
# in the builder stage and the React SPA in the Node (pwa) stage,
# so the context must NOT carry prebuilt outputs or local caches.
# In particular apps/pwa/dist is excluded on purpose: it is
# gitignored and rebuilt by `npm run build` in the pwa stage, so
# shipping a stale local dist would hide a broken Node build.
# Likewise node_modules is excluded: the pwa stage reinstalls the
# pinned dependencies with `npm ci` from package-lock.json.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.git/
nanobot/
*.egg-info/
backups/
nightly-smoke/
node_modules/
dist/
